{
  "packet": 9,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"……那一带应该有座古老堡垒。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么了，Paz？声音听起来很低沉。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯……那座堡垒是内战时期留下的。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"就是朝野党派之争最终演变成战争的那场内战？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。那场内战夺走了我的祖父母……同胞彼此残杀，是最愚蠢的战争……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那座堡垒铭刻着这份愚蠢。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真讽刺，如今雇佣兵又盘踞在那座堡垒里。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加正是反思那场内战才废除军队……求你了，Snake，把他们赶出去！","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"交给我。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C9B0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"等等，这和徒劳地反复搬石头有什么区别？我看只是在做无用功。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C9B0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"可是现在的哥斯达黎加应该没有多余电力。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02CFF0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这一带是热带云雾林，常年笼罩在白雾中，非常神秘。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02CFF0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所以叫“<R=乳之森,SELVA DE LA LECHE>”吗……视野似乎很差。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02CFF0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"真是的！明明还有人特意从国外赶来观察动物……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D350","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"很凶猛吗？别担心，蛇不可能被青蛙吃掉。反过来倒有可能……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D350","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"箭毒蛙类顾名思义带有毒素，强到原住民会用来制作毒箭。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Catarata de la Muerte意为“死亡瀑布”。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"真不吉利。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"Snake一定没问题，毕竟你以往也闯过许多绝境。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"说得倒轻松。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对不起。不过我真的很惊讶，原来“传奇士兵”的故事都是真的……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我既非英雄也不是传奇。可奇怪的是，由你说出来我倒不生气。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02D700","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"谢谢。小心啊，Snake。Peace。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02DA60","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"树懒很厉害，除了排泄几乎都待在树上，而且几乎不吃东西。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02DA60","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"可那样不是很快就会被吃掉吗？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02DA60","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"原来如此……动物和狙击手在森林中的生存策略相同，难怪那个老头那么厉害。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02E160","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"古代阿兹特克诸神之一，以花与美之女神闻名，据说身边伴随着蝴蝶和鸟儿。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02E610","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你还提到过滚落的巨大石球，那是什么？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02E610","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那或许能用来做陷阱。既然是真圆，应该很容易滚动……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02EA50","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过似乎没成功，我没听说现在这一带还有矿山在开采。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02EA50","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"总的来说，人们本就不太欢迎外资开采本国资源。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02EA50","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"四年前仅因允许外国企业取得采矿权，就发生过民众向国会投石的骚乱。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02EDB0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不。Snake或许舍弃了国家，但心里一定仍珍视祖国。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02F240","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"从那里到尼加拉瓜，一路全是湿地！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02F240","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯，我知道。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02F240","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"骑马通过一定很困难，小心！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02F3A0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"自建国以来，<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>从未凭自己的意志决定过前路。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FA90","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他是真正的英雄，堪称我们<R=桑地诺民族解放阵线,FSLN>之父。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FA90","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FA90","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"从那以后，<R=蛤蟆,SOMOZA>开始榨取祖国。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=蛤蟆,SOMOZA>家族控制尼加拉瓜，已经有40年了。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他们利用<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>为所欲为。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你们也是被<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>追赶，才来到<R=这里,哥斯达黎加>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"所有人都看<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>的脸色过活。即便如此，他们心情不好时还是会动手打人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"他们没收别人的土地纳为家族财产，如今全国近一半农田都归Somoza家族所有。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","unique_index":16,"cn_text":"国民的愤怒已经到达顶点，他们气数将尽。不，是我们一定会亲手结束这一切。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=第一代Somoza,TACHO>原本不过是<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>司令，根本不是当总统的材料。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"可当时的总统没有武力支持，唯一能以力量对抗他的只有Sandino将军……","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不，不是。只是将军决定站出来反抗。他并不是什么特殊人物。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"据说当时的美国总统曾说：“Somoza是个<R=混蛋,SON OF A BITCH>，但他是我们这边的<R=混蛋,SON OF A BITCH>。”","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0306F0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"意思是总比反美政权好，哪怕对方是狗或<R=蛤蟆,SOMOZA>。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_030DC0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"街道裂开无数缝隙，熟睡的孩子来不及逃走，就被倒塌的房屋压死，没能等到圣诞老人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_030DC0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"如今断层正上方仍十分危险，不能建房，市中心依旧是一片废墟。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_030DC0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"为了死去的人，我们绝不能输，一定要打倒Somoza。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031190","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"流经哥斯达黎加与尼加拉瓜边境的是<R=圣胡安河,RÍO SAN JUAN>，它连接<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>与加勒比海。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031190","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=公牛鲨,TIBURÓN TORO>能生活在河里。不过应该没事，一定会有<R=圣约翰,SAN JUAN>庇佑你。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031190","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"<R=圣胡安河,RÍO SAN JUAN>之名，源自为<R=耶稣,JESÚS>施洗的<R=圣约翰,SAN JUAN>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031670","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=尼加拉瓜湖,LAGO COCIBOLCA>上有座火山岛叫Ometepe。两座相连的火山，使它形似<R=葫芦,PORONGO>。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031670","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"真那样的话，<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>就完了。Snake，一定要阻止Peace Walker！","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031B20","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"“<R=自由祖国或死亡,PATRIA LIBRE O MORIR>”……这就是我们的口号。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031B20","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“<R=祖国或死亡,PATRIA O MUERTE>”……古巴革命的口号。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031B20","unique_index":18,"cn_text":"我们的同志还不算多，但一定会胜利。<R=胜利或死亡,VICTORIA O MUERTE>，这是革命者的宿命。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"50年前，尼加拉瓜政党之间发生内斗。美国海军陆战队以平息冲突为名介入。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"将军原本不是军人，他的同志们也一样，装备当然无法与海军陆战队相比。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"因此他充分利用地利，在<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>的山野间纵横，以神出鬼没的战法戏耍海军陆战队。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"人们欢欣鼓舞，称他为“<R=自由人的将军,GENERAL DE HOMBRES LIBRES>”并爱戴他。可是……","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0323D0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"即便将军被杀，他的意志仍由我们继承，哪怕时代不同。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"最近西瓜卖得怎么样？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"还过得去，留在<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>的<R=同志,COMPA>似乎也在努力。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那就好。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"……你很清楚<R=我们,桑地诺主义者>被叫作西瓜贩子啊。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不愧是Boss。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"你们为了躲过<R=国民警卫队,GUARDIA>监视，把武器藏进掏空的西瓜里运输。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"甚至包括<R=手榴弹,PINEAPPLE>。这件事传到邻国支持者那里……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你在说什么？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"咦？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"<R=我们,桑地诺主义者>之所以被叫作西瓜贩子，是因为<R=将军的名字,SANDINO>和<R=西瓜,SANDÍA>发音相似。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"……是这样吗？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"对。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_032C30","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"Kaz这家伙……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"}
  ]
}
